      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BALMORAL QUEEN (7) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last four runs. Last time finished 3rd on November 15 over 330m at this track behind Unleash In Miami beaten 2.25 lengths (18.90) in a Mix 1/2/3. Likely to be in the finish again. PELOPONNESE (4) was below best last time finishing fourth at this track, but prior to that had been racing well including a Grade 4/5 win two back at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Has the ability and can find best this time. LITTLE KING (5) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Wagga over 525m behind Merry Merriwa (30.77) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. A big run wouldn't surprise. HEY MARTY (1) placed last time out as public elect - worth considering.",
